B.ba8=s(["L\xe8 kota a fini, im\xe8l yo rete an atant. Im\xe8l ki bezwen verifikasyon mande kontw\xf2l nan Brevo anvan yo voye yo ank\xf2.","Quota \xe9puis\xe9 : les emails restent en attente. Les envois incertains doivent \xeatre v\xe9rifi\xe9s dans Brevo avant toute relance.","When quota is exhausted, emails stay queued. Uncertain sends must be checked in Brevo before retrying."],t.s)
